7-e5a35f0d733e?__dU__=v0G4RBKTXg2GsTlMa8YbE0npiPHb7Gzq29ujr-mrJsl6bcn0E30HNSquNCCrd1XNAz&__F__=v0fUYvjHMDjRPMSh3tviDHXIoXcPxvDgUUCCPvXMWoX_0JoZLAZABQFzGdi2cn1iU7KJEa5whIrwYtzM-cxLg6GYe6pJRTVluu9eAdKZVji2grrZ6A8sOcssRCu5P25VRL0lKL5NT6meymaTskNOlQqecDiG5J8uk_PjTzCufFDBkEeccUsXGV6_6Z9haD6Y5bg9U6Kc5YEomcGyvLykpe34NNONY_muuv3PFb-uOsfWqFALg-wB_aQ3bQYgLHFkL3AAQJGk-ntVroSu28fUAMTdD8n7HQ5GwSHKQ9sFADbw-dl4b5d1Qzo4ymRoo0OqxeaxHmy27helChTH1WMCcuIkByxF-0WHgVC1mes1NedHH8DEi1zrHaLXwU4gxhkcXa8vp1xEZ2hY0uZjf6hkWPrl4-MJq8lXxPULsXA-G5ofqYuIZ-CDLoYSy4dpqOnHn6lELmwtC-_8qUn9a3WqZMHb_qusDcfee1181T4_o3D5dn1AerVUm2f7czGbSUylUheBMU-15vn-0=" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(34, 81, 255); font-weight: inherit; background: none; text-decoration: underline;" data-link-id="9dc2c460848511f18524553c75d8513e">Lalit Bhagia</a></span>, and Emily Scofield outline five capabilities—including continuous insights, scaled creativity, and always-on orchestration—that can <span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 150%; color: rgb(34, 81, 255);"><a href="https://email.mckinsey.com/capabilities/growth-marketing-and-sales/our-insights/from-campaigns-to-continuous-growth-ai-capabilities-shaping-marketing?__hScId__=v710000019f87c74041a47f5b369ff0b0c8&__hRlId__=5462fb7c2e2b49890000021ef3a0bce4&__hDId__=5462fb7c-2e2b-4989-82f7-e5a35f0d733e&__hSD__=d3d3Lm1ja2luc2V5LmNvbQ==&cid=mgp_opr-eml-nsl-omcknsl-mgp-glb--&hlkid=459e2a3712a64a8db32da0086bc119f6&hctky=17208988&hdpid=5462fb7c-2e2b-4989-82f7-e5a35f0d733e" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(34, 81, 255); font-weight: inherit; background: none; text-decoration: underline;" data-link-id="b5edbf90848511f18524553c75d8513e">help companies build an AI-first growth engine</a></span>. Companies that redesign marketing around these capabilities could achieve 4% to 7% revenue growth while improving productivity.<br><br>﻿<a href="https://email.mckinsey.com/capabilities/growth-marketing-and-sales/our-insights/from-campaigns-to-continuou